{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0162","paragraphs":[{"id":"pc354de92085f-1","text":"金风细细。"},{"id":"p0000b6986a13-1","text":"叶叶梧桐坠。"},{"id":"p26e3d268c078-1","text":"绿酒初尝人易醉。"},{"id":"p9ba9dc68950c-1","text":"一枕小窗浓睡。"},{"id":"p10740e131782-1","text":"紫微朱槿花残。"},{"id":"pd07e03671c43-1","text":"斜阳却照阑干。"},{"id":"p03ea4d2ca292-1","text":"双燕欲归时节，银屏昨夜微寒。"}]}